window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a499-ac7bcac3c7f88ed8.json"]={sha256:"ac7bcac3c7f88ed804a649e98d35e302e755c0dec40d81fe9f77d5f1e7b44e22",value:{"id":"a499","title":"KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡","titleEn":"KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以神岡礦山地下超過 200 m 的 KAGRA 為對象，理解它如何用地底低地動與把 22.8 kg 藍寶石測試質量冷到約 20 K 兩個策略壓低雜訊，再把 3 km Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與訊號擷取、藍寶石光學、低溫懸吊導熱、熱連結振動、網路觀測與冷凝污染整合成可交接的觀測站工程。","summaryEn":"Taking KAGRA, more than 200 m underground in the Kamioka mine, see how it lowers noise with two strategies, a quiet underground site and 22.8 kg sapphire test masses cooled to about 20 K, then integrate 3 km Fabry–Pérot arms with signal extraction, sapphire optics, cryogenic heat extraction, heat-link vibration, network observing and cryo-contamination into a transferable observatory engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-facilities-observatories","subcategoryTitle":"大型望遠鏡與重力波觀測站","subcategoryTitleEn":"Large telescopes and gravitational-wave observatories","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-facilities-observatories","learningTags":["optics","optics-facilities-observatories","gw"],"architectureFamily":"gw","architectureNodes":[["1064 nm 雷射與輸入光學","1064 nm laser and input optics"],["功率回收與分光鏡","Power recycling and beam splitter"],["3 km Fabry–Pérot 臂腔","3 km Fabry–Pérot arm cavities"],["20 K 藍寶石低溫懸吊","20 K sapphire cryopayload"],["Type-A 隔振塔與冷凍機","Type-A towers and cryocoolers"],["訊號回收與讀出","Signal recycling and readout"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[4,3],[1,5]],"diagram":{"type":"gw","labels":["1064 nm 雷射與輸入光學","功率回收與分光鏡","3 km Fabry–Pérot 臂腔","20 K 藍寶石低溫懸吊","Type-A 隔振塔與冷凍機"],"labelsEn":["1064 nm laser and input optics","Power recycling and beam splitter","3 km Fabry–Pérot arm cavities","20 K sapphire cryopayload","Type-A towers and cryocoolers"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"低溫功率預算練習：設計分光鏡功率 674 W、臂腔精細度 1550，臂內功率 ≈ 674/2 × 2×1550/π ≈ 333 kW。假設輸入測試質量基板吸收 50 ppm/cm、厚 15 cm，鍍膜吸收 0.5 ppm，吸收熱 ≈ 337 × 7.5×10⁻⁴ + 333,000 × 5×10⁻⁷ ≈ 0.25 + 0.17 = 0.42 W。四根纖維熱導 G = 4kA/L，取 k = 2000 W/(m·K)、A = 2.0×10⁻⁶ m²、L = 0.35 m，G ≈ 0.046 W/K，溫差 ≈ 9.1 K；上一級 13 K 時鏡面約 22 K。熱雜訊振幅相對室溫降為 √(22/300) ≈ 0.27。若吸收倍增到 100 ppm/cm，熱量 0.67 W、溫差 14.6 K、鏡面約 27.6 K，需把分光鏡功率降到約 420 W 才能守住 22 K，臂內功率變為約 207 kW，散粒雜訊振幅約增為 √(333/207) ≈ 1.27 倍。數值為教學假設，不代表 KAGRA 的實際運轉參數。","textEn":"Cryogenic power-budget exercise: with the design 674 W at the beam splitter and finesse 1550, arm power ≈ 674/2 × 2×1550/π ≈ 333 kW. Assuming 50 ppm/cm absorption in the 15 cm input test-mass substrate and 0.5 ppm coating absorption, absorbed heat ≈ 337 × 7.5×10⁻⁴ + 333,000 × 5×10⁻⁷ ≈ 0.25 + 0.17 = 0.42 W. The four-fibre conductance G = 4kA/L with k = 2000 W/(m·K), A = 2.0×10⁻⁶ m² and L = 0.35 m is G ≈ 0.046 W/K, giving a temperature difference of about 9.1 K, so with the stage above at 13 K the mirror sits near 22 K. Thermal-noise amplitude relative to room temperature drops to √(22/300) ≈ 0.27. If absorption doubles to 100 ppm/cm, the heat is 0.67 W, the difference 14.6 K and the mirror about 27.6 K; holding 22 K requires cutting beam-splitter power to about 420 W, arm power to about 207 kW, and shot-noise amplitude rises by about √(333/207) ≈ 1.27. Values are teaching assumptions, not KAGRA operating parameters.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a499-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注」與「Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet\" and \"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a499-v12-01","title":"應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「3 km 臂與神岡地下站址」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “3 km arms and the Kamioka underground site” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"重力波通過時以應變 h = ΔL/L 拉伸與壓縮兩條垂直的臂，KAGRA 以兩條 3 km 臂的雷射干涉儀量測臂長差。地面干涉儀的低頻端主要受地動與重力梯度（牛頓）雜訊限制，中頻受鏡面與懸吊的熱雜訊限制。KAGRA 的兩個設計選擇正對應這兩項：把整座干涉儀建在岐阜縣神岡礦山岩層下超過 200 m 處，使 10 Hz 以上的地動比地面低約兩個數量級；並把測試質量與最末級懸吊冷到約 20 K，使熱雜訊隨溫度下降。這讓 KAGRA 成為第一座同時採用地底與低溫的公里級重力波望遠鏡，也帶來地下水、低溫振動與冷凝污染等新的工程問題。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「3 km 臂與神岡地下站址」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A passing gravitational wave stretches and squeezes two perpendicular arms with strain h = ΔL/L, and KAGRA measures the arm-length difference with a laser interferometer having two 3 km arms. Ground-based interferometers are limited at low frequency by ground motion and gravity-gradient (Newtonian) noise and at mid frequency by thermal noise of mirrors and suspensions. KAGRA's two design choices target exactly these: the whole interferometer sits more than 200 m under the rock of the Kamioka mine in Gifu Prefecture, where ground motion above 10 Hz is about two orders of magnitude lower than at the surface, and the test masses and final suspension stages are cooled to about 20 K so that thermal noise falls with temperature. This made KAGRA the first kilometre-scale detector to be both underground and cryogenic, and it introduced new engineering problems such as groundwater, cryogenic vibration and cryo-contamination. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “3 km arms and the Kamioka underground site”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：h = 1×10⁻²¹（教學假設）時 ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For h = 1×10⁻²¹ (teaching assumption) ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「3 km 臂與神岡地下站址」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “3 km arms and the Kamioka underground site”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-01-k1","title":"應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注","titleEn":"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet","text":"重力波通過時以應變 h = ΔL/L 拉伸與壓縮兩條垂直的臂，KAGRA 以兩條 3 km 臂的雷射干涉儀量測臂長差。地面干涉儀的低頻端主要受地動與重力梯度（牛頓）雜訊限制，中頻受鏡面與懸吊的熱雜訊限制。","textEn":"A passing gravitational wave stretches and squeezes two perpendicular arms with strain h = ΔL/L, and KAGRA measures the arm-length difference with a laser interferometer having two 3 km arms. Ground-based interferometers are limited at low frequency by ground motion and gravity-gradient (Newtonian) noise and at mid frequency by thermal noise of mirrors and suspensions.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet\" is correct?","options":["只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。","重力波通過時以應變 h = ΔL/L 拉伸與壓縮兩條垂直的臂，KAGRA 以兩條 3 km 臂的雷射干涉儀量測臂長差。","臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。"],"optionsEn":["Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.","A passing gravitational wave stretches and squeezes two perpendicular arms with strain h = ΔL/L, and KAGRA measures the arm-length difference with a laser interferometer having two 3 km arms.","Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重力波通過時以應變 h = ΔL/L 拉伸與壓縮兩條垂直的臂，KAGRA 以兩條 3 km 臂的雷射干涉儀量測臂長差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A passing gravitational wave stretches and squeezes two perpendicular arms with strain h = ΔL/L, and KAGRA measures the arm-length difference with a laser interferometer having two 3 km arms. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a499-v12-02","title":"應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注：定量估算","titleEn":"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「3 km 臂與神岡地下站址」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “3 km arms and the Kamioka underground site” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：h = 1×10⁻²¹（教學假設）時 ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m。布朗熱雜訊振幅約 ∝ √(T·φ)，損耗角不變時由 300 K 冷到 20 K 約降為 1/√15 ≈ 1/3.9；地下地動降低約 100 倍，相當於隔振需求少了 40 dB。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For h = 1×10⁻²¹ (teaching assumption) ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m. Brownian thermal-noise amplitude scales roughly as √(T·φ), so cooling from 300 K to 20 K at fixed loss angle lowers it by 1/√15 ≈ 1/3.9; the roughly 100-fold quieter underground ground motion is worth 40 dB of isolation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以寬頻地震儀同時記錄坑道內與地表的三軸地動，計算 1 到 100 Hz 的振幅譜密度比；以測試質量溫度計的讀值與擺的品質因子量測，估算熱雜訊並在干涉儀雜訊預算中與實測靈敏度曲線比對，確認哪一頻段由哪一項主導。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record three-axis ground motion simultaneously in the tunnel and at the surface with broadband seismometers and compute the amplitude-spectral-density ratio from 1 to 100 Hz; estimate thermal noise from test-mass thermometry and measured pendulum quality factors, and compare it in the interferometer noise budget with the measured sensitivity curve to see which term dominates each band.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"h = 1×10⁻²¹（教學假設）時 ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m。布朗熱雜訊振幅約 ∝ √(T·φ)，損耗角不變時由 300 K 冷到 20 K 約降為 1/√15 ≈ 1/3.9；地下地動降低約 100 倍，相當於隔振需求少了 40 dB。","textEn":"For h = 1×10⁻²¹ (teaching assumption) ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m. Brownian thermal-noise amplitude scales roughly as √(T·φ), so cooling from 300 K to 20 K at fixed loss angle lowers it by 1/√15 ≈ 1/3.9; the roughly 100-fold quieter underground ground motion is worth 40 dB of isolation.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet\", which statement holds?","options":["鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。","隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。","h = 1×10⁻²¹（教學假設）時 ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m。"],"optionsEn":["A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough.","A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.","For h = 1×10⁻²¹ (teaching assumption) ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"h = 1×10⁻²¹（教學假設）時 ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For h = 1×10⁻²¹ (teaching assumption) ΔL = h·L = 1×10⁻²¹ × 3000 m = 3×10⁻¹⁸ m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a499-v12-03","title":"應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「3 km 臂與神岡地下站址」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “3 km arms and the Kamioka underground site” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以寬頻地震儀同時記錄坑道內與地表的三軸地動，計算 1 到 100 Hz 的振幅譜密度比；以測試質量溫度計的讀值與擺的品質因子量測，估算熱雜訊並在干涉儀雜訊預算中與實測靈敏度曲線比對，確認哪一頻段由哪一項主導。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record three-axis ground motion simultaneously in the tunnel and at the surface with broadband seismometers and compute the amplitude-spectral-density ratio from 1 to 100 Hz; estimate thermal noise from test-mass thermometry and measured pendulum quality factors, and compare it in the interferometer noise budget with the measured sensitivity curve to see which term dominates each band. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若只把地底當成安靜的地方，而忽略岩體內的地下水與高濕度，電子設備腐蝕、局部積水與泵浦振動會成為新的雜訊與停機來源；若冷卻不到設計溫度，熱雜訊收益會遠低於預期，靈敏度停在室溫干涉儀的水準。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Treating the underground merely as a quiet place while ignoring groundwater and high humidity in the rock lets corrosion of electronics, local flooding and pump vibration become new noise and downtime sources; if the test masses never reach design temperature, the thermal-noise gain is far smaller than planned and sensitivity stays at room-temperature levels.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以寬頻地震儀同時記錄坑道內與地表的三軸地動，計算 1 到 100 Hz 的振幅譜密度比；以測試質量溫度計的讀值與擺的品質因子量測，估算熱雜訊並在干涉儀雜訊預算中與實測靈敏度曲線比對，確認哪一頻段由哪一項主導。","textEn":"Record three-axis ground motion simultaneously in the tunnel and at the surface with broadband seismometers and compute the amplitude-spectral-density ratio from 1 to 100 Hz; estimate thermal noise from test-mass thermometry and measured pendulum quality factors, and compare it in the interferometer noise budget with the measured sensitivity curve to see which term dominates each band.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet\"?","options":["以寬頻地震儀同時記錄坑道內與地表的三軸地動，計算 1 到 100 Hz 的振幅譜密度比。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["Record three-axis ground motion simultaneously in the tunnel and at the surface with broadband seismometers and compute the amplitude-spectral-density ratio from 1 to 100 Hz.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以寬頻地震儀同時記錄坑道內與地表的三軸地動，計算 1 到 100 Hz 的振幅譜密度比；以測試質量溫度計的讀值與擺的品質因子量測，估算熱雜訊並在干涉儀雜訊預算中與實測靈敏度曲線比對，確認哪一頻段由哪一項主導。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record three-axis ground motion simultaneously in the tunnel and at the surface with broadband seismometers and compute the amplitude-spectral-density ratio from 1 to 100 Hz; estimate thermal noise from test-mass thermometry and measured pendulum quality factors, and compare it in the interferometer noise budget with the measured sensitivity curve to see which term dominates each band. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a499-v12-04","title":"應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注：失效診斷","titleEn":"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「3 km 臂與神岡地下站址」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “3 km arms and the Kamioka underground site” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若只把地底當成安靜的地方，而忽略岩體內的地下水與高濕度，電子設備腐蝕、局部積水與泵浦振動會成為新的雜訊與停機來源；若冷卻不到設計溫度，熱雜訊收益會遠低於預期，靈敏度停在室溫干涉儀的水準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Treating the underground merely as a quiet place while ignoring groundwater and high humidity in the rock lets corrosion of electronics, local flooding and pump vibration become new noise and downtime sources; if the test masses never reach design temperature, the thermal-noise gain is far smaller than planned and sensitivity stays at room-temperature levels. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這讓 KAGRA 成為第一座同時採用地底與低溫的公里級重力波望遠鏡，也帶來地下水、低溫振動與冷凝污染等新的工程問題。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This made KAGRA the first kilometre-scale detector to be both underground and cryogenic, and it introduced new engineering problems such as groundwater, cryogenic vibration and cryo-contamination.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只把地底當成安靜的地方，而忽略岩體內的地下水與高濕度，電子設備腐蝕、局部積水與泵浦振動會成為新的雜訊與停機來源；若冷卻不到設計溫度，熱雜訊收益會遠低於預期，靈敏度停在室溫干涉儀的水準。","textEn":"Treating the underground merely as a quiet place while ignoring groundwater and high humidity in the rock lets corrosion of electronics, local flooding and pump vibration become new noise and downtime sources; if the test masses never reach design temperature, the thermal-noise gain is far smaller than planned and sensitivity stays at room-temperature levels.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「應變量測與地底加低溫的設計賭注」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Strain measurement and the underground-plus-cryogenic bet\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若只把地底當成安靜的地方，而忽略岩體內的地下水與高濕度，電子設備腐蝕、局部積水與泵浦振動會成為新的雜訊與停機來源。","臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Treating the underground merely as a quiet place while ignoring groundwater and high humidity in the rock lets corrosion of electronics, local flooding and pump vibration become new noise and downtime sources.","Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若只把地底當成安靜的地方，而忽略岩體內的地下水與高濕度，電子設備腐蝕、局部積水與泵浦振動會成為新的雜訊與停機來源；若冷卻不到設計溫度，熱雜訊收益會遠低於預期，靈敏度停在室溫干涉儀的水準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating the underground merely as a quiet place while ignoring groundwater and high humidity in the rock lets corrosion of electronics, local flooding and pump vibration become new noise and downtime sources; if the test masses never reach design temperature, the thermal-noise gain is far smaller than planned and sensitivity stays at room-temperature levels. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a499-v12-05","title":"Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「臂腔、功率回收與訊號回收鏡」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Arm cavities, power and signal recycling” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"KAGRA 在每條臂放入 Fabry–Pérot 共振腔，讓光在臂內往返數百次以放大臂長變化造成的相位；設計精細度上限約 1550，室溫實測約 1300 到 1400。分光鏡前的功率回收鏡把回到雷射方向的光再送回干涉儀，實測回收增益約 11 到 12；暗埠的訊號回收鏡則形成共振邊帶擷取（RSE）結構，讓高精細度臂腔儲存大功率的同時，把重力波訊號邊帶擷取出來，加寬偵測頻寬。高精細度的另一個用意是讓分光鏡與輸入測試質量基板內的功率較低，減少低溫鏡面的吸熱。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「臂腔、功率回收與訊號回收鏡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"KAGRA places a Fabry–Pérot cavity in each arm so that light makes hundreds of round trips and amplifies the phase produced by an arm-length change; the design finesse is capped near 1550, with about 1300 to 1400 measured at room temperature. A power-recycling mirror before the beam splitter sends light heading back to the laser into the interferometer again, with a measured recycling gain of about 11 to 12, and a signal-recycling mirror at the dark port forms a resonant-sideband-extraction (RSE) configuration that lets high-finesse arms store large power while extracting the gravitational-wave sidebands and widening the detection band. High finesse also keeps the power inside the beam splitter and input test-mass substrates low, reducing heating of the cryogenic mirrors. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Arm cavities, power and signal recycling”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：臂腔增益 ≈ 2F/π：F = 1550 時約 987，設計分光鏡功率 674 W 時每臂約 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Arm gain ≈ 2F/π: about 987 for F = 1550, so the design 674 W at the beam splitter gives about 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW per arm.","failure":"常見誤解：「臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「臂腔、功率回收與訊號回收鏡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Arm cavities, power and signal recycling”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-05-k1","title":"Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取","titleEn":"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction","text":"KAGRA 在每條臂放入 Fabry–Pérot 共振腔，讓光在臂內往返數百次以放大臂長變化造成的相位；設計精細度上限約 1550，室溫實測約 1300 到 1400。分光鏡前的功率回收鏡把回到雷射方向的光再送回干涉儀，實測回收增益約 11 到 12；暗埠的訊號回收鏡則形成共振邊帶擷取（RSE）結構，讓高精細度臂腔儲存大功率的同時，把重力波訊號邊帶擷取出來，加寬偵測頻寬。","textEn":"KAGRA places a Fabry–Pérot cavity in each arm so that light makes hundreds of round trips and amplifies the phase produced by an arm-length change; the design finesse is capped near 1550, with about 1300 to 1400 measured at room temperature. A power-recycling mirror before the beam splitter sends light heading back to the laser into the interferometer again, with a measured recycling gain of about 11 to 12, and a signal-recycling mirror at the dark port forms a resonant-sideband-extraction (RSE) configuration that lets high-finesse arms store large power while extracting the gravitational-wave sidebands and widening the detection band.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction\" is correct?","options":["臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。","熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。","KAGRA 在每條臂放入 Fabry–Pérot 共振腔，讓光在臂內往返數百次以放大臂長變化造成的相位。"],"optionsEn":["Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency.","Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold.","KAGRA places a Fabry–Pérot cavity in each arm so that light makes hundreds of round trips and amplifies the phase produced by an arm-length change."],"answer":2,"explanation":"KAGRA 在每條臂放入 Fabry–Pérot 共振腔，讓光在臂內往返數百次以放大臂長變化造成的相位；設計精細度上限約 1550，室溫實測約 1300 到 1400。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"KAGRA places a Fabry–Pérot cavity in each arm so that light makes hundreds of round trips and amplifies the phase produced by an arm-length change; the design finesse is capped near 1550, with about 1300 to 1400 measured at room temperature. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a499-v12-06","title":"Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取：定量估算","titleEn":"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「臂腔、功率回收與訊號回收鏡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Arm cavities, power and signal recycling” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：臂腔增益 ≈ 2F/π：F = 1550 時約 987，設計分光鏡功率 674 W 時每臂約 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW。腔極點 f_p = c/(4LF) ≈ 3×10⁸/(4×3000×1550) ≈ 16 Hz；RSE 的等效頻寬約 f_p·(1 + r_s)/(1 − r_s)：設計振幅反射率 r_s = 0.92 時約 390 Hz，安裝的 70% 功率反射（r_s ≈ 0.84）時約 180 Hz。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Arm gain ≈ 2F/π: about 987 for F = 1550, so the design 674 W at the beam splitter gives about 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW per arm. The cavity pole is f_p = c/(4LF) ≈ 3×10⁸/(4×3000×1550) ≈ 16 Hz; RSE widens the bandwidth to about f_p·(1 + r_s)/(1 − r_s), about 390 Hz for the design amplitude reflectivity r_s = 0.92 and about 180 Hz for the installed 70% power reflectivity (r_s ≈ 0.84). Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以掃頻或鎖定後的透射光衰減時間量測臂腔精細度；以功率回收腔鎖定前後的分光鏡處功率比得到回收增益；注入已知的差模長度調變並量測轉移函數，擬合出腔極點與訊號回收後的頻寬，再與設計值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure arm finesse from cavity scans or the ring-down of transmitted light; obtain the recycling gain from the ratio of beam-splitter power with and without the power-recycling cavity locked; inject a known differential length modulation, measure the transfer function and fit the cavity pole and the signal-recycled bandwidth for comparison with design.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"臂腔增益 ≈ 2F/π：F = 1550 時約 987，設計分光鏡功率 674 W 時每臂約 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW。腔極點 f_p = c/(4LF) ≈ 3×10⁸/(4×3000×1550) ≈ 16 Hz；RSE 的等效頻寬約 f_p·(1 + r_s)/(1 − r_s)：設計振幅反射率 r_s = 0.92 時約 390 Hz，安裝的 70% 功率反射（r_s ≈ 0.84）時約 180 Hz。","textEn":"Arm gain ≈ 2F/π: about 987 for F = 1550, so the design 674 W at the beam splitter gives about 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW per arm. The cavity pole is f_p = c/(4LF) ≈ 3×10⁸/(4×3000×1550) ≈ 16 Hz; RSE widens the bandwidth to about f_p·(1 + r_s)/(1 − r_s), about 390 Hz for the design amplitude reflectivity r_s = 0.92 and about 180 Hz for the installed 70% power reflectivity (r_s ≈ 0.84).","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction\", which statement holds?","options":["臂腔增益 ≈ 2F/π：F = 1550 時約 987，設計分光鏡功率 674 W 時每臂約 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW。","低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。","靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["Arm gain ≈ 2F/π: about 987 for F = 1550, so the design 674 W at the beam splitter gives about 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW per arm.","Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power.","A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"臂腔增益 ≈ 2F/π：F = 1550 時約 987，設計分光鏡功率 674 W 時每臂約 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Arm gain ≈ 2F/π: about 987 for F = 1550, so the design 674 W at the beam splitter gives about 674/2 × 987 ≈ 333 kW per arm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a499-v12-07","title":"Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「臂腔、功率回收與訊號回收鏡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Arm cavities, power and signal recycling” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以掃頻或鎖定後的透射光衰減時間量測臂腔精細度；以功率回收腔鎖定前後的分光鏡處功率比得到回收增益；注入已知的差模長度調變並量測轉移函數，擬合出腔極點與訊號回收後的頻寬，再與設計值比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure arm finesse from cavity scans or the ring-down of transmitted light; obtain the recycling gain from the ratio of beam-splitter power with and without the power-recycling cavity locked; inject a known differential length modulation, measure the transfer function and fit the cavity pole and the signal-recycled bandwidth for comparison with design. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：鏡面低溫後若表面吸附分子層使損耗增加，精細度與回收增益同時下降，臂內功率與靈敏度一起變差；訊號回收鏡反射率或失諧相位與設計不符時，偵測頻寬偏移，雜訊預算中的散粒雜訊曲線與實測對不上。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If molecular layers adsorb on the cold mirror surfaces and raise losses, finesse and recycling gain fall together, dragging arm power and sensitivity down; if the signal-recycling reflectivity or detuning phase departs from design, the detection band shifts and the shot-noise curve in the noise budget no longer matches measurement.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以掃頻或鎖定後的透射光衰減時間量測臂腔精細度；以功率回收腔鎖定前後的分光鏡處功率比得到回收增益；注入已知的差模長度調變並量測轉移函數，擬合出腔極點與訊號回收後的頻寬，再與設計值比較。","textEn":"Measure arm finesse from cavity scans or the ring-down of transmitted light; obtain the recycling gain from the ratio of beam-splitter power with and without the power-recycling cavity locked; inject a known differential length modulation, measure the transfer function and fit the cavity pole and the signal-recycled bandwidth for comparison with design.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以掃頻或鎖定後的透射光衰減時間量測臂腔精細度。","高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure arm finesse from cavity scans or the ring-down of transmitted light.","A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以掃頻或鎖定後的透射光衰減時間量測臂腔精細度；以功率回收腔鎖定前後的分光鏡處功率比得到回收增益；注入已知的差模長度調變並量測轉移函數，擬合出腔極點與訊號回收後的頻寬，再與設計值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure arm finesse from cavity scans or the ring-down of transmitted light; obtain the recycling gain from the ratio of beam-splitter power with and without the power-recycling cavity locked; inject a known differential length modulation, measure the transfer function and fit the cavity pole and the signal-recycled bandwidth for comparison with design. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a499-v12-08","title":"Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「臂腔、功率回收與訊號回收鏡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Arm cavities, power and signal recycling” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"鏡面低溫後若表面吸附分子層使損耗增加，精細度與回收增益同時下降，臂內功率與靈敏度一起變差；訊號回收鏡反射率或失諧相位與設計不符時，偵測頻寬偏移，雜訊預算中的散粒雜訊曲線與實測對不上。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If molecular layers adsorb on the cold mirror surfaces and raise losses, finesse and recycling gain fall together, dragging arm power and sensitivity down; if the signal-recycling reflectivity or detuning phase departs from design, the detection band shifts and the shot-noise curve in the noise budget no longer matches measurement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：高精細度的另一個用意是讓分光鏡與輸入測試質量基板內的功率較低，減少低溫鏡面的吸熱。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: High finesse also keeps the power inside the beam splitter and input test-mass substrates low, reducing heating of the cryogenic mirrors.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鏡面低溫後若表面吸附分子層使損耗增加，精細度與回收增益同時下降，臂內功率與靈敏度一起變差；訊號回收鏡反射率或失諧相位與設計不符時，偵測頻寬偏移，雜訊預算中的散粒雜訊曲線與實測對不上。","textEn":"If molecular layers adsorb on the cold mirror surfaces and raise losses, finesse and recycling gain fall together, dragging arm power and sensitivity down; if the signal-recycling reflectivity or detuning phase departs from design, the detection band shifts and the shot-noise curve in the noise budget no longer matches measurement.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Fabry–Pérot 臂腔與共振邊帶擷取」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fabry–Pérot arms and resonant sideband extraction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。","鏡面低溫後若表面吸附分子層使損耗增加，精細度與回收增益同時下降，臂內功率與靈敏度一起變差。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold.","If molecular layers adsorb on the cold mirror surfaces and raise losses, finesse and recycling gain fall together, dragging arm power and sensitivity down."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鏡面低溫後若表面吸附分子層使損耗增加，精細度與回收增益同時下降，臂內功率與靈敏度一起變差；訊號回收鏡反射率或失諧相位與設計不符時，偵測頻寬偏移，雜訊預算中的散粒雜訊曲線與實測對不上。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If molecular layers adsorb on the cold mirror surfaces and raise losses, finesse and recycling gain fall together, dragging arm power and sensitivity down; if the signal-recycling reflectivity or detuning phase departs from design, the detection band shifts and the shot-noise curve in the noise budget no longer matches measurement. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a499-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸」與「低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size\" and \"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a499-v12-09","title":"藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「c 軸藍寶石測試質量」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “c-axis sapphire test mass” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"KAGRA 的測試質量是直徑 22 cm、厚 15 cm、質量 22.8 kg 的 c 軸藍寶石，前表面曲率半徑約 1.9 km。選藍寶石而非熔融石英，是因為石英在低溫下機械損耗反而上升，而藍寶石在 20 K 附近熱導率極高、機械品質因子大且熱膨脹趨近於零，熱彈性雜訊與熱透鏡效應都隨之消失。代價是藍寶石為單軸晶體，光軸必須沿 c 軸以避免雙折射；晶體內吸收分布不均、大尺寸晶體取得困難，拋光與鍍膜也比石英難。鏡面上的光束越大，平均掉的鍍膜熱雜訊越多，但需要確保邊緣繞射損耗可忽略。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「c 軸藍寶石測試質量」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"KAGRA's test masses are c-axis sapphire, 22 cm in diameter, 15 cm thick and 22.8 kg, with a front-surface radius of curvature of about 1.9 km. Sapphire was chosen over fused silica because silica's mechanical loss rises at low temperature, whereas sapphire near 20 K has very high thermal conductivity, a high mechanical quality factor and a thermal expansion that tends to zero, so thermoelastic noise and thermal lensing both vanish. The price is that sapphire is uniaxial, so the beam must travel along the c-axis to avoid birefringence; absorption is inhomogeneous within the crystal, large crystals are hard to obtain, and polishing and coating are harder than for silica. A larger beam on the mirror averages away more coating thermal noise, provided edge diffraction loss stays negligible. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “c-axis sapphire test mass”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：質量 m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Mass m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg.","failure":"常見誤解：「熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「c 軸藍寶石測試質量」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “c-axis sapphire test mass”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-09-k1","title":"藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸","titleEn":"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size","text":"KAGRA 的測試質量是直徑 22 cm、厚 15 cm、質量 22.8 kg 的 c 軸藍寶石，前表面曲率半徑約 1.9 km。選藍寶石而非熔融石英，是因為石英在低溫下機械損耗反而上升，而藍寶石在 20 K 附近熱導率極高、機械品質因子大且熱膨脹趨近於零，熱彈性雜訊與熱透鏡效應都隨之消失。","textEn":"KAGRA's test masses are c-axis sapphire, 22 cm in diameter, 15 cm thick and 22.8 kg, with a front-surface radius of curvature of about 1.9 km. Sapphire was chosen over fused silica because silica's mechanical loss rises at low temperature, whereas sapphire near 20 K has very high thermal conductivity, a high mechanical quality factor and a thermal expansion that tends to zero, so thermoelastic noise and thermal lensing both vanish.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size\" is correct?","options":["KAGRA 的測試質量是直徑 22 cm、厚 15 cm、質量 22.8 kg 的 c 軸藍寶石，前表面曲率半徑約 1.9 km。","熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。","鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。"],"optionsEn":["KAGRA's test masses are c-axis sapphire, 22 cm in diameter, 15 cm thick and 22.8 kg, with a front-surface radius of curvature of about 1.9 km.","Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold.","A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough."],"answer":0,"explanation":"KAGRA 的測試質量是直徑 22 cm、厚 15 cm、質量 22.8 kg 的 c 軸藍寶石，前表面曲率半徑約 1.9 km。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"KAGRA's test masses are c-axis sapphire, 22 cm in diameter, 15 cm thick and 22.8 kg, with a front-surface radius of curvature of about 1.9 km. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a499-v12-10","title":"藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸：定量估算","titleEn":"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「c 軸藍寶石測試質量」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “c-axis sapphire test mass” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：質量 m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg。對稱腔 L = 3000 m、R = 1900 m 時 g = 1 − L/R ≈ −0.579，鏡面光束半徑 w² = (λL/π)/√(1 − g²) 給出 λ = 1064 nm 時 w ≈ 35 mm；22 cm 鏡面的邊緣截斷損耗 exp(−2a²/w²) ≈ 4×10⁻⁹，可忽略。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Mass m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg. For a symmetric cavity with L = 3000 m and R = 1900 m, g = 1 − L/R ≈ −0.579, and the mirror beam radius from w² = (λL/π)/√(1 − g²) at λ = 1064 nm is about 35 mm; the clipping loss of a 22 cm mirror, exp(−2a²/w²), is about 4×10⁻⁹ and negligible. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以偏振量測檢查基板沿光軸的雙折射與 c 軸對準誤差；以光熱共光路干涉法掃描基板的吸收分布圖；以干涉儀量測鍍膜後的面形與曲率半徑，並把實測曲率代入腔模型，預測光束半徑與高階模態間距，與腔掃描時的模態頻率比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check birefringence along the beam axis and c-axis alignment error with polarimetry; map substrate absorption with photothermal common-path interferometry; measure post-coating figure and radius of curvature interferometrically, feed the measured curvature into the cavity model to predict beam radius and higher-order-mode spacing, and compare with mode frequencies seen in cavity scans.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"質量 m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg。對稱腔 L = 3000 m、R = 1900 m 時 g = 1 − L/R ≈ −0.579，鏡面光束半徑 w² = (λL/π)/√(1 − g²) 給出 λ = 1064 nm 時 w ≈ 35 mm；22 cm 鏡面的邊緣截斷損耗 exp(−2a²/w²) ≈ 4×10⁻⁹，可忽略。","textEn":"Mass m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg. For a symmetric cavity with L = 3000 m and R = 1900 m, g = 1 − L/R ≈ −0.579, and the mirror beam radius from w² = (λL/π)/√(1 − g²) at λ = 1064 nm is about 35 mm; the clipping loss of a 22 cm mirror, exp(−2a²/w²), is about 4×10⁻⁹ and negligible.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size\", which statement holds?","options":["隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。","質量 m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg。","高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。"],"optionsEn":["A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.","Mass m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg.","A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas."],"answer":1,"explanation":"質量 m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Mass m = ρ·π·r²·t = 3980 × π × 0.11² × 0.15 ≈ 22.7 kg. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a499-v12-11","title":"藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「c 軸藍寶石測試質量」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “c-axis sapphire test mass” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以偏振量測檢查基板沿光軸的雙折射與 c 軸對準誤差；以光熱共光路干涉法掃描基板的吸收分布圖；以干涉儀量測鍍膜後的面形與曲率半徑，並把實測曲率代入腔模型，預測光束半徑與高階模態間距，與腔掃描時的模態頻率比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check birefringence along the beam axis and c-axis alignment error with polarimetry; map substrate absorption with photothermal common-path interferometry; measure post-coating figure and radius of curvature interferometrically, feed the measured curvature into the cavity model to predict beam radius and higher-order-mode spacing, and compare with mode frequencies seen in cavity scans. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若晶體 c 軸與光軸偏差數度，穿過輸入測試質量的光產生偏振轉換，部分功率變成無法共振的偏振，回收增益下降並增加暗埠雜光；吸收熱點則在低溫下集中加熱，使鏡面局部溫度偏高。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the crystal c-axis is a few degrees off the beam axis, light passing through the input test mass undergoes polarisation conversion, part of the power ends up in a non-resonant polarisation, recycling gain falls and dark-port stray light grows; absorption hot spots concentrate heating and leave the mirror locally warmer at cryogenic temperature.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以偏振量測檢查基板沿光軸的雙折射與 c 軸對準誤差；以光熱共光路干涉法掃描基板的吸收分布圖；以干涉儀量測鍍膜後的面形與曲率半徑，並把實測曲率代入腔模型，預測光束半徑與高階模態間距，與腔掃描時的模態頻率比對。","textEn":"Check birefringence along the beam axis and c-axis alignment error with polarimetry; map substrate absorption with photothermal common-path interferometry; measure post-coating figure and radius of curvature interferometrically, feed the measured curvature into the cavity model to predict beam radius and higher-order-mode spacing, and compare with mode frequencies seen in cavity scans.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。","以偏振量測檢查基板沿光軸的雙折射與 c 軸對準誤差。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.","Check birefringence along the beam axis and c-axis alignment error with polarimetry."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以偏振量測檢查基板沿光軸的雙折射與 c 軸對準誤差；以光熱共光路干涉法掃描基板的吸收分布圖；以干涉儀量測鍍膜後的面形與曲率半徑，並把實測曲率代入腔模型，預測光束半徑與高階模態間距，與腔掃描時的模態頻率比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check birefringence along the beam axis and c-axis alignment error with polarimetry; map substrate absorption with photothermal common-path interferometry; measure post-coating figure and radius of curvature interferometrically, feed the measured curvature into the cavity model to predict beam radius and higher-order-mode spacing, and compare with mode frequencies seen in cavity scans. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a499-v12-12","title":"藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「c 軸藍寶石測試質量」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “c-axis sapphire test mass” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若晶體 c 軸與光軸偏差數度，穿過輸入測試質量的光產生偏振轉換，部分功率變成無法共振的偏振，回收增益下降並增加暗埠雜光；吸收熱點則在低溫下集中加熱，使鏡面局部溫度偏高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the crystal c-axis is a few degrees off the beam axis, light passing through the input test mass undergoes polarisation conversion, part of the power ends up in a non-resonant polarisation, recycling gain falls and dark-port stray light grows; absorption hot spots concentrate heating and leave the mirror locally warmer at cryogenic temperature. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：鏡面上的光束越大，平均掉的鍍膜熱雜訊越多，但需要確保邊緣繞射損耗可忽略。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A larger beam on the mirror averages away more coating thermal noise, provided edge diffraction loss stays negligible.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若晶體 c 軸與光軸偏差數度，穿過輸入測試質量的光產生偏振轉換，部分功率變成無法共振的偏振，回收增益下降並增加暗埠雜光；吸收熱點則在低溫下集中加熱，使鏡面局部溫度偏高。","textEn":"If the crystal c-axis is a few degrees off the beam axis, light passing through the input test mass undergoes polarisation conversion, part of the power ends up in a non-resonant polarisation, recycling gain falls and dark-port stray light grows; absorption hot spots concentrate heating and leave the mirror locally warmer at cryogenic temperature.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「藍寶石測試質量：材料、雙折射與光束尺寸」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sapphire test masses: material, birefringence and beam size\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若晶體 c 軸與光軸偏差數度，穿過輸入測試質量的光產生偏振轉換，部分功率變成無法共振的偏振，回收增益下降並增加暗埠雜光。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。"],"optionsEn":["If the crystal c-axis is a few degrees off the beam axis, light passing through the input test mass undergoes polarisation conversion, part of the power ends up in a non-resonant polarisation, recycling gain falls and dark-port stray light grows.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若晶體 c 軸與光軸偏差數度，穿過輸入測試質量的光產生偏振轉換，部分功率變成無法共振的偏振，回收增益下降並增加暗埠雜光；吸收熱點則在低溫下集中加熱，使鏡面局部溫度偏高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the crystal c-axis is a few degrees off the beam axis, light passing through the input test mass undergoes polarisation conversion, part of the power ends up in a non-resonant polarisation, recycling gain falls and dark-port stray light grows; absorption hot spots concentrate heating and leave the mirror locally warmer at cryogenic temperature. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a499-v12-13","title":"低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「低溫懸吊與藍寶石纖維」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cryopayload and sapphire fibres” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"測試質量在真空中懸吊，熱只能經由懸吊纖維傳導或輻射散失；而在 20 K 附近輻射散熱極弱，所以吸收的雷射熱必須沿四根長 35 cm、粗 1.6 mm 的藍寶石纖維傳到上一級質量，再經純鋁熱連結傳到低溫恆溫器。每座恆溫器有四台二級脈衝管冷凍機，全站共 16 台，並以 8 K 內層與 80 K 外層輻射屏蔽包圍；長約 5 m 的導管屏蔽阻擋室溫熱輻射沿光路進入。纖維必須同時夠細以降低懸吊熱雜訊、夠粗以帶走熱，形成直接的設計取捨。2018 年首次低溫運轉時，一面端測試質量約 30 天降到 18 K。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「低溫懸吊與藍寶石纖維」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The test mass hangs in vacuum and can lose heat only by conduction along its suspension fibres or by radiation, and radiation is very weak near 20 K, so absorbed laser heat must flow through four sapphire fibres 35 cm long and 1.6 mm thick to the stage above, then through pure-aluminium heat links to the cryostat. Each cryostat has four two-stage pulse-tube cryocoolers, 16 in all, with inner 8 K and outer 80 K radiation shields, and duct shields about 5 m long stop room-temperature radiation from entering along the beam path. The fibres must be thin to reduce suspension thermal noise yet thick enough to carry the heat, a direct design trade-off. In the first cryogenic operation in 2018, an end test mass took about 30 days to reach 18 K. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Cryopayload and sapphire fibres”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：四根纖維的熱導 G = 4kA/L：假設細纖維在 20 K 的熱導率 k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K)，A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m²，L = 0.35 m，G ≈ 0.046 W/K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The conductance of four fibres is G = 4kA/L: assuming k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K) for thin fibres at 20 K, A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m² and L = 0.35 m, G ≈ 0.046 W/K.","failure":"常見誤解：「鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「低溫懸吊與藍寶石纖維」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Cryopayload and sapphire fibres”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-13-k1","title":"低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間","titleEn":"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time","text":"測試質量在真空中懸吊，熱只能經由懸吊纖維傳導或輻射散失；而在 20 K 附近輻射散熱極弱，所以吸收的雷射熱必須沿四根長 35 cm、粗 1.6 mm 的藍寶石纖維傳到上一級質量，再經純鋁熱連結傳到低溫恆溫器。每座恆溫器有四台二級脈衝管冷凍機，全站共 16 台，並以 8 K 內層與 80 K 外層輻射屏蔽包圍；長約 5 m 的導管屏蔽阻擋室溫熱輻射沿光路進入。","textEn":"The test mass hangs in vacuum and can lose heat only by conduction along its suspension fibres or by radiation, and radiation is very weak near 20 K, so absorbed laser heat must flow through four sapphire fibres 35 cm long and 1.6 mm thick to the stage above, then through pure-aluminium heat links to the cryostat. Each cryostat has four two-stage pulse-tube cryocoolers, 16 in all, with inner 8 K and outer 80 K radiation shields, and duct shields about 5 m long stop room-temperature radiation from entering along the beam path.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time\" is correct?","options":["鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。","測試質量在真空中懸吊，熱只能經由懸吊纖維傳導或輻射散失。","低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough.","The test mass hangs in vacuum and can lose heat only by conduction along its suspension fibres or by radiation, and radiation is very weak near 20 K, so absorbed laser heat must flow through four sapphire fibres 35 cm long and 1.6 mm thick to the stage above, then through pure-aluminium heat links to the cryostat.","Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power."],"answer":1,"explanation":"測試質量在真空中懸吊，熱只能經由懸吊纖維傳導或輻射散失；而在 20 K 附近輻射散熱極弱，所以吸收的雷射熱必須沿四根長 35 cm、粗 1.6 mm 的藍寶石纖維傳到上一級質量，再經純鋁熱連結傳到低溫恆溫器。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The test mass hangs in vacuum and can lose heat only by conduction along its suspension fibres or by radiation, and radiation is very weak near 20 K, so absorbed laser heat must flow through four sapphire fibres 35 cm long and 1.6 mm thick to the stage above, then through pure-aluminium heat links to the cryostat. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a499-v12-14","title":"低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「低溫懸吊與藍寶石纖維」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cryopayload and sapphire fibres” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：四根纖維的熱導 G = 4kA/L：假設細纖維在 20 K 的熱導率 k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K)，A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m²，L = 0.35 m，G ≈ 0.046 W/K。若鏡面吸收 0.42 W，鏡面比上一級高 ΔT = Q/G ≈ 9 K；上一級 13 K 時鏡面約 22 K，正是設計溫度上限。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The conductance of four fibres is G = 4kA/L: assuming k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K) for thin fibres at 20 K, A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m² and L = 0.35 m, G ≈ 0.046 W/K. If the mirror absorbs 0.42 W, it runs ΔT = Q/G ≈ 9 K warmer than the stage above; with that stage at 13 K the mirror sits near 22 K, right at the design limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在各級質量與屏蔽上裝校正過的低溫溫度計，記錄冷卻曲線並以熱容與熱導模型擬合；在穩態下改變臂內功率，量測鏡面與上一級的溫差對吸收功率的斜率，反推纖維與接合面的實際熱導，再與設計值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Mount calibrated cryogenic thermometers on every stage and shield, record the cool-down curves and fit them with heat-capacity and conductance models; in steady state vary arm power and measure the slope of the mirror-to-stage temperature difference versus absorbed power to back out the real conductance of fibres and joints, then compare with design.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"四根纖維的熱導 G = 4kA/L：假設細纖維在 20 K 的熱導率 k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K)，A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m²，L = 0.35 m，G ≈ 0.046 W/K。若鏡面吸收 0.42 W，鏡面比上一級高 ΔT = Q/G ≈ 9 K；上一級 13 K 時鏡面約 22 K，正是設計溫度上限。","textEn":"The conductance of four fibres is G = 4kA/L: assuming k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K) for thin fibres at 20 K, A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m² and L = 0.35 m, G ≈ 0.046 W/K. If the mirror absorbs 0.42 W, it runs ΔT = Q/G ≈ 9 K warmer than the stage above; with that stage at 13 K the mirror sits near 22 K, right at the design limit.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time\", which statement holds?","options":["靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。","只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。","四根纖維的熱導 G = 4kA/L：假設細纖維在 20 K 的熱導率 k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K)，A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m²，L = 0.35 m，G ≈ 0.046 W/K。"],"optionsEn":["A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing.","Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.","The conductance of four fibres is G = 4kA/L: assuming k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K) for thin fibres at 20 K, A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m² and L = 0.35 m, G ≈ 0.046 W/K."],"answer":2,"explanation":"四根纖維的熱導 G = 4kA/L：假設細纖維在 20 K 的熱導率 k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K)，A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m²，L = 0.35 m，G ≈ 0.046 W/K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The conductance of four fibres is G = 4kA/L: assuming k ≈ 2000 W/(m·K) for thin fibres at 20 K, A = π(0.8 mm)² ≈ 2.0×10⁻⁶ m² and L = 0.35 m, G ≈ 0.046 W/K. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a499-v12-15","title":"低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「低溫懸吊與藍寶石纖維」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Cryopayload and sapphire fibres” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在各級質量與屏蔽上裝校正過的低溫溫度計，記錄冷卻曲線並以熱容與熱導模型擬合；在穩態下改變臂內功率，量測鏡面與上一級的溫差對吸收功率的斜率，反推纖維與接合面的實際熱導，再與設計值比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Mount calibrated cryogenic thermometers on every stage and shield, record the cool-down curves and fit them with heat-capacity and conductance models; in steady state vary arm power and measure the slope of the mirror-to-stage temperature difference versus absorbed power to back out the real conductance of fibres and joints, then compare with design. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：纖維與鏡體接合面（例如接合鉤）熱阻偏大時，同樣吸收功率下鏡面溫度明顯升高，熱雜訊收益消失，只能降低輸入功率而犧牲高頻散粒雜訊；熱連結若太硬，又會把恆溫器振動直接帶進鏡面。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the joint between fibre and mirror body has excess thermal resistance, the same absorbed power raises the mirror temperature markedly, the thermal-noise gain disappears and input power must be cut at the expense of high-frequency shot noise; heat links that are too stiff carry cryostat vibration straight into the mirror.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在各級質量與屏蔽上裝校正過的低溫溫度計，記錄冷卻曲線並以熱容與熱導模型擬合；在穩態下改變臂內功率，量測鏡面與上一級的溫差對吸收功率的斜率，反推纖維與接合面的實際熱導，再與設計值比較。","textEn":"Mount calibrated cryogenic thermometers on every stage and shield, record the cool-down curves and fit them with heat-capacity and conductance models; in steady state vary arm power and measure the slope of the mirror-to-stage temperature difference versus absorbed power to back out the real conductance of fibres and joints, then compare with design.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time\"?","options":["在各級質量與屏蔽上裝校正過的低溫溫度計，記錄冷卻曲線並以熱容與熱導模型擬合。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。"],"optionsEn":["Mount calibrated cryogenic thermometers on every stage and shield, record the cool-down curves and fit them with heat-capacity and conductance models.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在各級質量與屏蔽上裝校正過的低溫溫度計，記錄冷卻曲線並以熱容與熱導模型擬合；在穩態下改變臂內功率，量測鏡面與上一級的溫差對吸收功率的斜率，反推纖維與接合面的實際熱導，再與設計值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Mount calibrated cryogenic thermometers on every stage and shield, record the cool-down curves and fit them with heat-capacity and conductance models; in steady state vary arm power and measure the slope of the mirror-to-stage temperature difference versus absorbed power to back out the real conductance of fibres and joints, then compare with design. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a499-v12-16","title":"低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「低溫懸吊與藍寶石纖維」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Cryopayload and sapphire fibres” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"纖維與鏡體接合面（例如接合鉤）熱阻偏大時，同樣吸收功率下鏡面溫度明顯升高，熱雜訊收益消失，只能降低輸入功率而犧牲高頻散粒雜訊；熱連結若太硬，又會把恆溫器振動直接帶進鏡面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the joint between fibre and mirror body has excess thermal resistance, the same absorbed power raises the mirror temperature markedly, the thermal-noise gain disappears and input power must be cut at the expense of high-frequency shot noise; heat links that are too stiff carry cryostat vibration straight into the mirror. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：2018 年首次低溫運轉時，一面端測試質量約 30 天降到 18 K。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In the first cryogenic operation in 2018, an end test mass took about 30 days to reach 18 K.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"纖維與鏡體接合面（例如接合鉤）熱阻偏大時，同樣吸收功率下鏡面溫度明顯升高，熱雜訊收益消失，只能降低輸入功率而犧牲高頻散粒雜訊；熱連結若太硬，又會把恆溫器振動直接帶進鏡面。","textEn":"If the joint between fibre and mirror body has excess thermal resistance, the same absorbed power raises the mirror temperature markedly, the thermal-noise gain disappears and input power must be cut at the expense of high-frequency shot noise; heat links that are too stiff carry cryostat vibration straight into the mirror.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低溫懸吊、藍寶石纖維導熱與冷卻時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cryopayload, sapphire-fibre heat extraction and cool-down time\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","纖維與鏡體接合面（例如接合鉤）熱阻偏大時，同樣吸收功率下鏡面溫度明顯升高，熱雜訊收益消失，只能降低輸入功率而犧牲高頻散粒雜訊。","低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If the joint between fibre and mirror body has excess thermal resistance, the same absorbed power raises the mirror temperature markedly, the thermal-noise gain disappears and input power must be cut at the expense of high-frequency shot noise.","Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power."],"answer":1,"explanation":"纖維與鏡體接合面（例如接合鉤）熱阻偏大時，同樣吸收功率下鏡面溫度明顯升高，熱雜訊收益消失，只能降低輸入功率而犧牲高頻散粒雜訊；熱連結若太硬，又會把恆溫器振動直接帶進鏡面。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the joint between fibre and mirror body has excess thermal resistance, the same absorbed power raises the mirror temperature markedly, the thermal-noise gain disappears and input power must be cut at the expense of high-frequency shot noise; heat links that are too stiff carry cryostat vibration straight into the mirror. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a499-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限」與「隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors\" and \"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a499-v12-17","title":"低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「吸收熱預算與臂內功率」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Absorption heat budget and arm power” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"室溫干涉儀可以不斷提高雷射功率來壓低散粒雜訊，再以熱補償系統處理熱透鏡；KAGRA 則被低溫限制：鏡面吸收的每一瓦都必須經由細纖維帶走，因此吸收熱預算直接決定可用的臂內功率。熱源有兩部分：輸入測試質量的基板吸收（光以回收腔功率穿過 15 cm 藍寶石）與每面鏡的鍍膜吸收（以臂內數百 kW 的功率計算）。由於藍寶石在低溫下的折射率溫度係數與膨脹極小，熱透鏡幾乎不存在，問題完全變成熱量是否送得出去。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「吸收熱預算與臂內功率」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A room-temperature interferometer can keep raising laser power to suppress shot noise and treat thermal lensing with a compensation system, but KAGRA is bounded by cryogenics: every watt absorbed by a mirror must leave through thin fibres, so the absorption heat budget sets the usable arm power. There are two heat sources: substrate absorption in the input test mass, where light crosses 15 cm of sapphire at the recycling-cavity power, and coating absorption on every mirror at the arm power of hundreds of kilowatts. Because sapphire's thermo-optic coefficient and expansion are tiny when cold, thermal lensing is almost absent and the problem becomes purely whether the heat can be extracted. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Absorption heat budget and arm power”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：假設基板吸收 50 ppm/cm、鍍膜吸收 0.5 ppm：基板熱 = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W，鍍膜熱 = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W，合計約 0.42 W。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Assume 50 ppm/cm substrate and 0.5 ppm coating absorption: substrate heat = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W and coating heat = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W, about 0.42 W in total.","failure":"常見誤解：「低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「吸收熱預算與臂內功率」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Absorption heat budget and arm power”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-17-k1","title":"低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限","titleEn":"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors","text":"室溫干涉儀可以不斷提高雷射功率來壓低散粒雜訊，再以熱補償系統處理熱透鏡；KAGRA 則被低溫限制：鏡面吸收的每一瓦都必須經由細纖維帶走，因此吸收熱預算直接決定可用的臂內功率。熱源有兩部分：輸入測試質量的基板吸收（光以回收腔功率穿過 15 cm 藍寶石）與每面鏡的鍍膜吸收（以臂內數百 kW 的功率計算）。","textEn":"A room-temperature interferometer can keep raising laser power to suppress shot noise and treat thermal lensing with a compensation system, but KAGRA is bounded by cryogenics: every watt absorbed by a mirror must leave through thin fibres, so the absorption heat budget sets the usable arm power. There are two heat sources: substrate absorption in the input test mass, where light crosses 15 cm of sapphire at the recycling-cavity power, and coating absorption on every mirror at the arm power of hundreds of kilowatts.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors\" is correct?","options":["低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。","隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。","室溫干涉儀可以不斷提高雷射功率來壓低散粒雜訊，再以熱補償系統處理熱透鏡。"],"optionsEn":["Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power.","A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.","A room-temperature interferometer can keep raising laser power to suppress shot noise and treat thermal lensing with a compensation system, but KAGRA is bounded by cryogenics: every watt absorbed by a mirror must leave through thin fibres, so the absorption heat budget sets the usable arm power."],"answer":2,"explanation":"室溫干涉儀可以不斷提高雷射功率來壓低散粒雜訊，再以熱補償系統處理熱透鏡；KAGRA 則被低溫限制：鏡面吸收的每一瓦都必須經由細纖維帶走，因此吸收熱預算直接決定可用的臂內功率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A room-temperature interferometer can keep raising laser power to suppress shot noise and treat thermal lensing with a compensation system, but KAGRA is bounded by cryogenics: every watt absorbed by a mirror must leave through thin fibres, so the absorption heat budget sets the usable arm power. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a499-v12-18","title":"低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限：定量估算","titleEn":"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「吸收熱預算與臂內功率」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Absorption heat budget and arm power” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：假設基板吸收 50 ppm/cm、鍍膜吸收 0.5 ppm：基板熱 = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W，鍍膜熱 = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W，合計約 0.42 W。若基板吸收不均使局部達 100 ppm/cm，合計約 0.67 W，在 G ≈ 0.046 W/K 時溫差升到約 15 K；要守住 0.42 W，分光鏡功率需降到約 674 × 0.62 ≈ 420 W。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Assume 50 ppm/cm substrate and 0.5 ppm coating absorption: substrate heat = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W and coating heat = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W, about 0.42 W in total. If inhomogeneous sapphire reaches 100 ppm/cm the total is about 0.67 W and, with G ≈ 0.046 W/K, the temperature difference rises to about 15 K; holding 0.42 W requires cutting beam-splitter power to about 674 × 0.62 ≈ 420 W. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：安裝前以光熱法量測基板吸收分布並計算沿光束路徑的加權平均；運轉中逐步提高輸入功率，同時記錄鏡面溫度、臂內功率與回收增益，擬合溫升對臂內功率的斜率，分離基板與鍍膜兩項吸收，作為設定最大輸入功率的依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before installation map substrate absorption photothermally and compute the beam-weighted average along the path; in operation raise input power step by step while logging mirror temperature, arm power and recycling gain, and fit the temperature rise versus arm power to separate substrate and coating absorption as the basis for the maximum input power.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"假設基板吸收 50 ppm/cm、鍍膜吸收 0.5 ppm：基板熱 = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W，鍍膜熱 = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W，合計約 0.42 W。若基板吸收不均使局部達 100 ppm/cm，合計約 0.67 W，在 G ≈ 0.046 W/K 時溫差升到約 15 K；要守住 0.42 W，分光鏡功率需降到約 674 × 0.62 ≈ 420 W。","textEn":"Assume 50 ppm/cm substrate and 0.5 ppm coating absorption: substrate heat = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W and coating heat = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W, about 0.42 W in total. If inhomogeneous sapphire reaches 100 ppm/cm the total is about 0.67 W and, with G ≈ 0.046 W/K, the temperature difference rises to about 15 K; holding 0.42 W requires cutting beam-splitter power to about 674 × 0.62 ≈ 420 W.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors\", which statement holds?","options":["假設基板吸收 50 ppm/cm、鍍膜吸收 0.5 ppm：基板熱 = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W，鍍膜熱 = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W，合計約 0.42 W。","高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。","臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。"],"optionsEn":["Assume 50 ppm/cm substrate and 0.5 ppm coating absorption: substrate heat = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W and coating heat = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W, about 0.42 W in total.","A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas.","Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"假設基板吸收 50 ppm/cm、鍍膜吸收 0.5 ppm：基板熱 = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W，鍍膜熱 = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W，合計約 0.42 W。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Assume 50 ppm/cm substrate and 0.5 ppm coating absorption: substrate heat = 337 W × 50×10⁻⁶/cm × 15 cm ≈ 0.25 W and coating heat = 333 kW × 0.5×10⁻⁶ ≈ 0.17 W, about 0.42 W in total. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a499-v12-19","title":"低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「吸收熱預算與臂內功率」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Absorption heat budget and arm power” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"安裝前以光熱法量測基板吸收分布並計算沿光束路徑的加權平均；運轉中逐步提高輸入功率，同時記錄鏡面溫度、臂內功率與回收增益，擬合溫升對臂內功率的斜率，分離基板與鍍膜兩項吸收，作為設定最大輸入功率的依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before installation map substrate absorption photothermally and compute the beam-weighted average along the path; in operation raise input power step by step while logging mirror temperature, arm power and recycling gain, and fit the temperature rise versus arm power to separate substrate and coating absorption as the basis for the maximum input power. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若只用晶體平均吸收值估熱，而光束恰好穿過吸收熱點，實際溫度高於預期，熱雜訊與纖維熱導同時惡化，干涉儀在升功率途中失鎖或必須退回低功率運轉。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Estimating heat from a crystal-average absorption while the beam happens to cross an absorption hot spot leaves the real temperature higher than expected, worsening thermal noise and fibre conductance together, so the interferometer loses lock during power-up or must retreat to low power.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"安裝前以光熱法量測基板吸收分布並計算沿光束路徑的加權平均；運轉中逐步提高輸入功率，同時記錄鏡面溫度、臂內功率與回收增益，擬合溫升對臂內功率的斜率，分離基板與鍍膜兩項吸收，作為設定最大輸入功率的依據。","textEn":"Before installation map substrate absorption photothermally and compute the beam-weighted average along the path; in operation raise input power step by step while logging mirror temperature, arm power and recycling gain, and fit the temperature rise versus arm power to separate substrate and coating absorption as the basis for the maximum input power.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","安裝前以光熱法量測基板吸收分布並計算沿光束路徑的加權平均。","熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before installation map substrate absorption photothermally and compute the beam-weighted average along the path.","Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold."],"answer":1,"explanation":"安裝前以光熱法量測基板吸收分布並計算沿光束路徑的加權平均；運轉中逐步提高輸入功率，同時記錄鏡面溫度、臂內功率與回收增益，擬合溫升對臂內功率的斜率，分離基板與鍍膜兩項吸收，作為設定最大輸入功率的依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before installation map substrate absorption photothermally and compute the beam-weighted average along the path; in operation raise input power step by step while logging mirror temperature, arm power and recycling gain, and fit the temperature rise versus arm power to separate substrate and coating absorption as the basis for the maximum input power. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a499-v12-20","title":"低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限：失效診斷","titleEn":"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「吸收熱預算與臂內功率」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Absorption heat budget and arm power” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若只用晶體平均吸收值估熱，而光束恰好穿過吸收熱點，實際溫度高於預期，熱雜訊與纖維熱導同時惡化，干涉儀在升功率途中失鎖或必須退回低功率運轉。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Estimating heat from a crystal-average absorption while the beam happens to cross an absorption hot spot leaves the real temperature higher than expected, worsening thermal noise and fibre conductance together, so the interferometer loses lock during power-up or must retreat to low power. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：由於藍寶石在低溫下的折射率溫度係數與膨脹極小，熱透鏡幾乎不存在，問題完全變成熱量是否送得出去。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because sapphire's thermo-optic coefficient and expansion are tiny when cold, thermal lensing is almost absent and the problem becomes purely whether the heat can be extracted.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只用晶體平均吸收值估熱，而光束恰好穿過吸收熱點，實際溫度高於預期，熱雜訊與纖維熱導同時惡化，干涉儀在升功率途中失鎖或必須退回低功率運轉。","textEn":"Estimating heat from a crystal-average absorption while the beam happens to cross an absorption hot spot leaves the real temperature higher than expected, worsening thermal noise and fibre conductance together, so the interferometer loses lock during power-up or must retreat to low power.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低溫鏡面的吸收熱預算與功率上限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Absorption heat budget and the power ceiling of cryogenic mirrors\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。","若只用晶體平均吸收值估熱，而光束恰好穿過吸收熱點，實際溫度高於預期，熱雜訊與纖維熱導同時惡化，干涉儀在升功率途中失鎖或必須退回低功率運轉。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.","Estimating heat from a crystal-average absorption while the beam happens to cross an absorption hot spot leaves the real temperature higher than expected, worsening thermal noise and fibre conductance together, so the interferometer loses lock during power-up or must retreat to low power."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若只用晶體平均吸收值估熱，而光束恰好穿過吸收熱點，實際溫度高於預期，熱雜訊與纖維熱導同時惡化，干涉儀在升功率途中失鎖或必須退回低功率運轉。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Estimating heat from a crystal-average absorption while the beam happens to cross an absorption hot spot leaves the real temperature higher than expected, worsening thermal noise and fibre conductance together, so the interferometer loses lock during power-up or must retreat to low power. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a499-v12-21","title":"隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「Type-A 隔振塔與熱連結」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Type-A tower and heat links” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"KAGRA 的測試質量掛在高 13.5 m 的 Type-A 系統下：上方為倒立擺與多級幾何反彈簧濾波器組成的室溫隔振鏈，下方接入低溫恆溫器內的低溫懸吊；分光鏡與訊號回收鏡使用較短的 Type-B 系統，功率回收鏡使用 Type-Bp。低溫設計的特殊風險是熱連結：它必須接到懸吊鏈中才能導熱，等於在精心設計的隔振鏈旁開了一條振動捷徑，把冷凍機與屏蔽的振動帶入鏡面。因此熱連結要做得非常柔軟，並接在已被隔振的中間級，而不是直接接在鏡體附近。地下的低地動讓這條預算可行，但不會自動解決熱連結問題。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Type-A 隔振塔與熱連結」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"KAGRA's test masses hang below the 13.5 m Type-A system: an inverted pendulum and multiple geometric-anti-spring filters form a room-temperature isolation chain above, which connects to the cryogenic payload inside the cryostat; the beam splitter and signal-recycling mirror use the shorter Type-B system and the power-recycling mirrors Type-Bp. The special cryogenic risk is the heat link: it must attach to the suspension chain to carry heat, which opens a vibration shortcut beside a carefully designed isolation chain and brings cryocooler and shield vibration into the mirror. The links must therefore be extremely soft and attached at already-isolated intermediate stages rather than near the mirror. Low underground ground motion makes the budget feasible but does not solve the heat-link problem by itself. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Type-A tower and heat links”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：假設地下 10 Hz 地動 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz、隔振鏈 5 級各共振 0.5 Hz，傳遞 ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³，鏡面約 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Assume 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz of underground motion at 10 Hz and a 5-stage chain with 0.5 Hz resonances: transmission ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³ leaves about 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz at the mirror.","failure":"常見誤解：「隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Type-A 隔振塔與熱連結」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Type-A tower and heat links”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-21-k1","title":"隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算","titleEn":"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget","text":"KAGRA 的測試質量掛在高 13.5 m 的 Type-A 系統下：上方為倒立擺與多級幾何反彈簧濾波器組成的室溫隔振鏈，下方接入低溫恆溫器內的低溫懸吊；分光鏡與訊號回收鏡使用較短的 Type-B 系統，功率回收鏡使用 Type-Bp。低溫設計的特殊風險是熱連結：它必須接到懸吊鏈中才能導熱，等於在精心設計的隔振鏈旁開了一條振動捷徑，把冷凍機與屏蔽的振動帶入鏡面。","textEn":"KAGRA's test masses hang below the 13.5 m Type-A system: an inverted pendulum and multiple geometric-anti-spring filters form a room-temperature isolation chain above, which connects to the cryogenic payload inside the cryostat; the beam splitter and signal-recycling mirror use the shorter Type-B system and the power-recycling mirrors Type-Bp. The special cryogenic risk is the heat link: it must attach to the suspension chain to carry heat, which opens a vibration shortcut beside a carefully designed isolation chain and brings cryocooler and shield vibration into the mirror.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget\" is correct?","options":["KAGRA 的測試質量掛在高 13.5 m 的 Type-A 系統下：上方為倒立擺與多級幾何反彈簧濾波器組成的室溫隔振鏈，下方接入低溫恆溫器內的低溫懸吊。","隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。","靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["KAGRA's test masses hang below the 13.5 m Type-A system: an inverted pendulum and multiple geometric-anti-spring filters form a room-temperature isolation chain above, which connects to the cryogenic payload inside the cryostat.","A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.","A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"KAGRA 的測試質量掛在高 13.5 m 的 Type-A 系統下：上方為倒立擺與多級幾何反彈簧濾波器組成的室溫隔振鏈，下方接入低溫恆溫器內的低溫懸吊；分光鏡與訊號回收鏡使用較短的 Type-B 系統，功率回收鏡使用 Type-Bp。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"KAGRA's test masses hang below the 13.5 m Type-A system: an inverted pendulum and multiple geometric-anti-spring filters form a room-temperature isolation chain above, which connects to the cryogenic payload inside the cryostat; the beam splitter and signal-recycling mirror use the shorter Type-B system and the power-recycling mirrors Type-Bp. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a499-v12-22","title":"隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Type-A 隔振塔與熱連結」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Type-A tower and heat links” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：假設地下 10 Hz 地動 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz、隔振鏈 5 級各共振 0.5 Hz，傳遞 ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³，鏡面約 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz。若 h = 1×10⁻²²/√Hz，單面鏡容許 h·L/2 = 1.5×10⁻¹⁹ m/√Hz。但屏蔽振動 1×10⁻⁹ m/√Hz 若經熱連結只過兩級 1 Hz 濾波，殘餘 (1/10)⁴ × 10⁻⁹ = 1×10⁻¹³ m/√Hz，超標近百萬倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Assume 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz of underground motion at 10 Hz and a 5-stage chain with 0.5 Hz resonances: transmission ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³ leaves about 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz at the mirror. For h = 1×10⁻²²/√Hz a single mirror may move h·L/2 = 1.5×10⁻¹⁹ m/√Hz. Yet shield vibration of 1×10⁻⁹ m/√Hz reaching the mirror through a heat link past only two 1 Hz stages leaves (1/10)⁴ × 10⁻⁹ = 1×10⁻¹³ m/√Hz, nearly a million times too much. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在冷凍機運轉與暫停的條件下分別量測恆溫器屏蔽與懸吊各級的加速度譜，比較差值以找出經熱連結進入的振動；以注入式量測（在屏蔽上施加已知振動）求得屏蔽到鏡面的耦合轉移函數，並把結果放進干涉儀雜訊預算。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure acceleration spectra of cryostat shields and each suspension stage with the cryocoolers running and paused, and compare to isolate vibration entering through the heat links; inject known vibration on the shield to measure the shield-to-mirror coupling transfer function and place the result in the interferometer noise budget.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"假設地下 10 Hz 地動 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz、隔振鏈 5 級各共振 0.5 Hz，傳遞 ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³，鏡面約 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz。若 h = 1×10⁻²²/√Hz，單面鏡容許 h·L/2 = 1.5×10⁻¹⁹ m/√Hz。但屏蔽振動 1×10⁻⁹ m/√Hz 若經熱連結只過兩級 1 Hz 濾波，殘餘 (1/10)⁴ × 10⁻⁹ = 1×10⁻¹³ m/√Hz，超標近百萬倍。","textEn":"Assume 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz of underground motion at 10 Hz and a 5-stage chain with 0.5 Hz resonances: transmission ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³ leaves about 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz at the mirror. For h = 1×10⁻²²/√Hz a single mirror may move h·L/2 = 1.5×10⁻¹⁹ m/√Hz. Yet shield vibration of 1×10⁻⁹ m/√Hz reaching the mirror through a heat link past only two 1 Hz stages leaves (1/10)⁴ × 10⁻⁹ = 1×10⁻¹³ m/√Hz, nearly a million times too much.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget\", which statement holds?","options":["只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。","假設地下 10 Hz 地動 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz、隔振鏈 5 級各共振 0.5 Hz，傳遞 ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³，鏡面約 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz。","熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。"],"optionsEn":["Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.","Assume 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz of underground motion at 10 Hz and a 5-stage chain with 0.5 Hz resonances: transmission ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³ leaves about 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz at the mirror.","Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold."],"answer":1,"explanation":"假設地下 10 Hz 地動 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz、隔振鏈 5 級各共振 0.5 Hz，傳遞 ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³，鏡面約 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Assume 1×10⁻¹¹ m/√Hz of underground motion at 10 Hz and a 5-stage chain with 0.5 Hz resonances: transmission ≈ (0.5/10)¹⁰ ≈ 1×10⁻¹³ leaves about 1×10⁻²⁴ m/√Hz at the mirror. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a499-v12-23","title":"隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Type-A 隔振塔與熱連結」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Type-A tower and heat links” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在冷凍機運轉與暫停的條件下分別量測恆溫器屏蔽與懸吊各級的加速度譜，比較差值以找出經熱連結進入的振動；以注入式量測（在屏蔽上施加已知振動）求得屏蔽到鏡面的耦合轉移函數，並把結果放進干涉儀雜訊預算。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure acceleration spectra of cryostat shields and each suspension stage with the cryocoolers running and paused, and compare to isolate vibration entering through the heat links; inject known vibration on the shield to measure the shield-to-mirror coupling transfer function and place the result in the interferometer noise budget. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：熱連結在冷卻收縮後變緊或碰觸屏蔽，會在靈敏度曲線上出現與冷凍機頻率及其諧波相關的尖峰與寬帶雜訊；若誤以為來自地動而加強隔振鏈，問題不會消失。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A heat link that tightens after thermal contraction or touches a shield produces peaks and broadband noise at the cryocooler frequency and its harmonics in the sensitivity curve; treating it as ground motion and strengthening the isolation chain does not make it go away.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在冷凍機運轉與暫停的條件下分別量測恆溫器屏蔽與懸吊各級的加速度譜，比較差值以找出經熱連結進入的振動；以注入式量測（在屏蔽上施加已知振動）求得屏蔽到鏡面的耦合轉移函數，並把結果放進干涉儀雜訊預算。","textEn":"Measure acceleration spectra of cryostat shields and each suspension stage with the cryocoolers running and paused, and compare to isolate vibration entering through the heat links; inject known vibration on the shield to measure the shield-to-mirror coupling transfer function and place the result in the interferometer noise budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。","在冷凍機運轉與暫停的條件下分別量測恆溫器屏蔽與懸吊各級的加速度譜，比較差值以找出經熱連結進入的振動。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough.","Measure acceleration spectra of cryostat shields and each suspension stage with the cryocoolers running and paused, and compare to isolate vibration entering through the heat links."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在冷凍機運轉與暫停的條件下分別量測恆溫器屏蔽與懸吊各級的加速度譜，比較差值以找出經熱連結進入的振動；以注入式量測（在屏蔽上施加已知振動）求得屏蔽到鏡面的耦合轉移函數，並把結果放進干涉儀雜訊預算。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure acceleration spectra of cryostat shields and each suspension stage with the cryocoolers running and paused, and compare to isolate vibration entering through the heat links; inject known vibration on the shield to measure the shield-to-mirror coupling transfer function and place the result in the interferometer noise budget. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a499-v12-24","title":"隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Type-A 隔振塔與熱連結」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Type-A tower and heat links” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"熱連結在冷卻收縮後變緊或碰觸屏蔽，會在靈敏度曲線上出現與冷凍機頻率及其諧波相關的尖峰與寬帶雜訊；若誤以為來自地動而加強隔振鏈，問題不會消失。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A heat link that tightens after thermal contraction or touches a shield produces peaks and broadband noise at the cryocooler frequency and its harmonics in the sensitivity curve; treating it as ground motion and strengthening the isolation chain does not make it go away. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：地下的低地動讓這條預算可行，但不會自動解決熱連結問題。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Low underground ground motion makes the budget feasible but does not solve the heat-link problem by itself.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"熱連結在冷卻收縮後變緊或碰觸屏蔽，會在靈敏度曲線上出現與冷凍機頻率及其諧波相關的尖峰與寬帶雜訊；若誤以為來自地動而加強隔振鏈，問題不會消失。","textEn":"A heat link that tightens after thermal contraction or touches a shield produces peaks and broadband noise at the cryocooler frequency and its harmonics in the sensitivity curve; treating it as ground motion and strengthening the isolation chain does not make it go away.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「隔振鏈、熱連結振動與地下雜訊預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Isolation chain, heat-link vibration and the underground noise budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["熱連結在冷卻收縮後變緊或碰觸屏蔽，會在靈敏度曲線上出現與冷凍機頻率及其諧波相關的尖峰與寬帶雜訊；若誤以為來自地動而加強隔振鏈，問題不會消失。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["A heat link that tightens after thermal contraction or touches a shield produces peaks and broadband noise at the cryocooler frequency and its harmonics in the sensitivity curve.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"熱連結在冷卻收縮後變緊或碰觸屏蔽，會在靈敏度曲線上出現與冷凍機頻率及其諧波相關的尖峰與寬帶雜訊；若誤以為來自地動而加強隔振鏈，問題不會消失。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A heat link that tightens after thermal contraction or touches a shield produces peaks and broadband noise at the cryocooler frequency and its harmonics in the sensitivity curve; treating it as ground motion and strengthening the isolation chain does not make it go away. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a499-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位」與「地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation\" and \"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a499-v12-25","title":"網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA 觀測網路」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA network” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"單一干涉儀無法精確判斷重力波來源方向，多座相距數千公里的干涉儀以到達時間差、振幅比與相位比進行三角定位。KAGRA 在 2020 年 2 月開始首次觀測，同年 4 月與 GEO600 聯合觀測時中子星雙星靈敏距離約 1 Mpc；2023 年 5 月加入第四輪觀測 O4，2024 年 1 月能登半島地震後進行設施檢查與修復，2025 年 6 月與 LIGO、Virgo 協調恢復 O4，直到 2025 年 11 月 O4 完成。KAGRA 的方位與緯度不同，天線響應圖案與其他偵測器互補，即使靈敏距離較短，也能改善網路的定位與偏振量測。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA 觀測網路」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A single interferometer cannot locate a gravitational-wave source precisely, so detectors thousands of kilometres apart triangulate using arrival-time differences, amplitude ratios and phase ratios. KAGRA began its first observing run in February 2020 and reached a binary-neutron-star range of about 1 Mpc during joint observation with GEO600 that April; it joined the fourth observing run O4 in May 2023, underwent facility inspection and repair after the January 2024 Noto Peninsula earthquake, resumed O4 in coordination with LIGO and Virgo in June 2025, and remained until O4 ended in November 2025. Its different orientation and latitude give an antenna pattern that complements the other detectors, improving network localisation and polarisation measurement even with a shorter range. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA network”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：偵測體積 ∝ 靈敏距離³：由 1 Mpc 提升到 10 Mpc，體積增加 10³ = 1000 倍。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Detection volume scales as range³: going from 1 Mpc to 10 Mpc increases it 10³ = 1000 times.","failure":"常見誤解：「靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA 觀測網路」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA network”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-25-k1","title":"網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位","titleEn":"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation","text":"單一干涉儀無法精確判斷重力波來源方向，多座相距數千公里的干涉儀以到達時間差、振幅比與相位比進行三角定位。KAGRA 在 2020 年 2 月開始首次觀測，同年 4 月與 GEO600 聯合觀測時中子星雙星靈敏距離約 1 Mpc；2023 年 5 月加入第四輪觀測 O4，2024 年 1 月能登半島地震後進行設施檢查與修復，2025 年 6 月與 LIGO、Virgo 協調恢復 O4，直到 2025 年 11 月 O4 完成。","textEn":"A single interferometer cannot locate a gravitational-wave source precisely, so detectors thousands of kilometres apart triangulate using arrival-time differences, amplitude ratios and phase ratios. KAGRA began its first observing run in February 2020 and reached a binary-neutron-star range of about 1 Mpc during joint observation with GEO600 that April; it joined the fourth observing run O4 in May 2023, underwent facility inspection and repair after the January 2024 Noto Peninsula earthquake, resumed O4 in coordination with LIGO and Virgo in June 2025, and remained until O4 ended in November 2025.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation\" is correct?","options":["靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。","單一干涉儀無法精確判斷重力波來源方向，多座相距數千公里的干涉儀以到達時間差、振幅比與相位比進行三角定位。","高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。"],"optionsEn":["A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing.","A single interferometer cannot locate a gravitational-wave source precisely, so detectors thousands of kilometres apart triangulate using arrival-time differences, amplitude ratios and phase ratios.","A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas."],"answer":1,"explanation":"單一干涉儀無法精確判斷重力波來源方向，多座相距數千公里的干涉儀以到達時間差、振幅比與相位比進行三角定位。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A single interferometer cannot locate a gravitational-wave source precisely, so detectors thousands of kilometres apart triangulate using arrival-time differences, amplitude ratios and phase ratios. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a499-v12-26","title":"網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位：定量估算","titleEn":"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA 觀測網路」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA network” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：偵測體積 ∝ 靈敏距離³：由 1 Mpc 提升到 10 Mpc，體積增加 10³ = 1000 倍。若另一偵測器的距離為 160 Mpc（假設），10 Mpc 的 KAGRA 偵測體積只有 (10/160)³ ≈ 2.4×10⁻⁴，所以 KAGRA 早期的主要貢獻是為其他偵測器觸發的事件提供額外基線，而非獨立發現事件。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Detection volume scales as range³: going from 1 Mpc to 10 Mpc increases it 10³ = 1000 times. If another detector has a 160 Mpc range (assumption), a 10 Mpc KAGRA covers only (10/160)³ ≈ 2.4×10⁻⁴ of its volume, so KAGRA's early contribution is an extra baseline for events triggered by other detectors rather than independent discoveries. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以光子校正器（1047 nm 雷射推動測試質量）產生已知位移，建立應變校正與時間戳準確度；以 GPS 同步的時間系統比對各站資料，並以網路分析中注入的模擬訊號檢查定位面積隨 KAGRA 加入與否的變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Generate known displacements with the photon calibrator, a 1047 nm laser pushing the test mass, to establish strain calibration and timestamp accuracy; compare data across sites with GPS-synchronised timing, and check how localisation area changes with and without KAGRA using simulated signals injected into network analysis.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"偵測體積 ∝ 靈敏距離³：由 1 Mpc 提升到 10 Mpc，體積增加 10³ = 1000 倍。若另一偵測器的距離為 160 Mpc（假設），10 Mpc 的 KAGRA 偵測體積只有 (10/160)³ ≈ 2.4×10⁻⁴，所以 KAGRA 早期的主要貢獻是為其他偵測器觸發的事件提供額外基線，而非獨立發現事件。","textEn":"Detection volume scales as range³: going from 1 Mpc to 10 Mpc increases it 10³ = 1000 times. If another detector has a 160 Mpc range (assumption), a 10 Mpc KAGRA covers only (10/160)³ ≈ 2.4×10⁻⁴ of its volume, so KAGRA's early contribution is an extra baseline for events triggered by other detectors rather than independent discoveries.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation\", which statement holds?","options":["臂腔精細度越高，干涉儀在所有頻率都越靈敏。","鏡面在真空中冷卻，只要冷凍機功率夠大就能維持低溫。","偵測體積 ∝ 靈敏距離³：由 1 Mpc 提升到 10 Mpc，體積增加 10³ = 1000 倍。"],"optionsEn":["Higher arm finesse makes the interferometer more sensitive at every frequency.","A mirror in vacuum stays cold as long as the cryocoolers are powerful enough.","Detection volume scales as range³: going from 1 Mpc to 10 Mpc increases it 10³ = 1000 times."],"answer":2,"explanation":"偵測體積 ∝ 靈敏距離³：由 1 Mpc 提升到 10 Mpc，體積增加 10³ = 1000 倍。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Detection volume scales as range³: going from 1 Mpc to 10 Mpc increases it 10³ = 1000 times. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a499-v12-27","title":"網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA 觀測網路」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA network” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以光子校正器（1047 nm 雷射推動測試質量）產生已知位移，建立應變校正與時間戳準確度；以 GPS 同步的時間系統比對各站資料，並以網路分析中注入的模擬訊號檢查定位面積隨 KAGRA 加入與否的變化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Generate known displacements with the photon calibrator, a 1047 nm laser pushing the test mass, to establish strain calibration and timestamp accuracy; compare data across sites with GPS-synchronised timing, and check how localisation area changes with and without KAGRA using simulated signals injected into network analysis. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若時間戳或校正相位有毫秒級或數度的系統誤差，KAGRA 的資料在三角定位中會把天區推向錯誤位置，反而降低網路定位品質；觀測期間若鎖定時間比例低，網路中同時運轉的偵測器組合減少。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A millisecond timestamp error or a few degrees of calibration phase error makes KAGRA data push the sky location to the wrong place in triangulation, degrading rather than improving network localisation; a low lock duty factor during a run reduces the number of times all detectors observe together.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以光子校正器（1047 nm 雷射推動測試質量）產生已知位移，建立應變校正與時間戳準確度；以 GPS 同步的時間系統比對各站資料，並以網路分析中注入的模擬訊號檢查定位面積隨 KAGRA 加入與否的變化。","textEn":"Generate known displacements with the photon calibrator, a 1047 nm laser pushing the test mass, to establish strain calibration and timestamp accuracy; compare data across sites with GPS-synchronised timing, and check how localisation area changes with and without KAGRA using simulated signals injected into network analysis.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation\"?","options":["以光子校正器（1047 nm 雷射推動測試質量）產生已知位移，建立應變校正與時間戳準確度。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Generate known displacements with the photon calibrator, a 1047 nm laser pushing the test mass, to establish strain calibration and timestamp accuracy.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以光子校正器（1047 nm 雷射推動測試質量）產生已知位移，建立應變校正與時間戳準確度；以 GPS 同步的時間系統比對各站資料，並以網路分析中注入的模擬訊號檢查定位面積隨 KAGRA 加入與否的變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Generate known displacements with the photon calibrator, a 1047 nm laser pushing the test mass, to establish strain calibration and timestamp accuracy; compare data across sites with GPS-synchronised timing, and check how localisation area changes with and without KAGRA using simulated signals injected into network analysis. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a499-v12-28","title":"網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位：失效診斷","titleEn":"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA 觀測網路」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “LIGO–Virgo–KAGRA network” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若時間戳或校正相位有毫秒級或數度的系統誤差，KAGRA 的資料在三角定位中會把天區推向錯誤位置，反而降低網路定位品質；觀測期間若鎖定時間比例低，網路中同時運轉的偵測器組合減少。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A millisecond timestamp error or a few degrees of calibration phase error makes KAGRA data push the sky location to the wrong place in triangulation, degrading rather than improving network localisation; a low lock duty factor during a run reduces the number of times all detectors observe together. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：KAGRA 的方位與緯度不同，天線響應圖案與其他偵測器互補，即使靈敏距離較短，也能改善網路的定位與偏振量測。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Its different orientation and latitude give an antenna pattern that complements the other detectors, improving network localisation and polarisation measurement even with a shorter range.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「靈敏距離較短的偵測器對網路觀測沒有幫助。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A detector with a shorter range adds nothing to network observing.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若時間戳或校正相位有毫秒級或數度的系統誤差，KAGRA 的資料在三角定位中會把天區推向錯誤位置，反而降低網路定位品質；觀測期間若鎖定時間比例低，網路中同時運轉的偵測器組合減少。","textEn":"A millisecond timestamp error or a few degrees of calibration phase error makes KAGRA data push the sky location to the wrong place in triangulation, degrading rather than improving network localisation; a low lock duty factor during a run reduces the number of times all detectors observe together.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「網路觀測：靈敏距離、偵測體積與定位」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Network observing: sensitive range, detection volume and localisation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若時間戳或校正相位有毫秒級或數度的系統誤差，KAGRA 的資料在三角定位中會把天區推向錯誤位置，反而降低網路定位品質。","高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A millisecond timestamp error or a few degrees of calibration phase error makes KAGRA data push the sky location to the wrong place in triangulation, degrading rather than improving network localisation.","A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若時間戳或校正相位有毫秒級或數度的系統誤差，KAGRA 的資料在三角定位中會把天區推向錯誤位置，反而降低網路定位品質；觀測期間若鎖定時間比例低，網路中同時運轉的偵測器組合減少。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A millisecond timestamp error or a few degrees of calibration phase error makes KAGRA data push the sky location to the wrong place in triangulation, degrading rather than improving network localisation; a low lock duty factor during a run reduces the number of times all detectors observe together. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a499-v12-29","title":"地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「冷鏡面分子吸附與回溫」如何決定KAGRA 地底低溫重力波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cold-mirror adsorption and warm-up” determines the key performance of “KAGRA underground cryogenic gravitational-wave telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"低溫鏡面本身就是一個冷凝泵：真空中殘留的水分子一碰到 20 K 的鏡面就會吸附，逐漸形成分子層，改變鍍膜的反射率並增加吸收與散射。KAGRA 以長導管屏蔽限制殘氣進入的立體角，但吸附無法完全避免，必要時需回溫讓分子脫附，而每次回溫與再冷卻都要數週時間。地下設施另有地下水、濕度與地震等風險，2024 年能登半島地震後就需要逐項檢查懸吊、真空與光學對準。交接紀錄應包含各鏡面溫度歷史、精細度與回收增益趨勢、冷凍機與真空狀態，以及每次回溫的原因與結果。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「冷鏡面分子吸附與回溫」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A cryogenic mirror is itself a cryopump: residual water molecules in the vacuum that strike the 20 K surface stick and slowly build a molecular layer that changes coating reflectance and adds absorption and scatter. KAGRA uses long duct shields to restrict the solid angle through which residual gas can arrive, but adsorption cannot be avoided completely, so the mirrors must sometimes be warmed to desorb the layer, and every warm-up and re-cooling takes weeks. The underground facility also faces groundwater, humidity and earthquakes; after the 2024 Noto Peninsula earthquake, suspensions, vacuum and optical alignment all had to be checked item by item. The handoff record should hold each mirror's temperature history, finesse and recycling-gain trends, cryocooler and vacuum status, and the reason and outcome of every warm-up. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Cold-mirror adsorption and warm-up”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：水分子撞擊率 Φ = P/√(2πmkT)：P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa、T = 300 K、m = 18 u 時 Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The water impingement rate is Φ = P/√(2πmkT): for P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa, T = 300 K and m = 18 u, Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹.","failure":"常見誤解：「高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「冷鏡面分子吸附與回溫」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Cold-mirror adsorption and warm-up”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-29-k1","title":"地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接","titleEn":"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff","text":"低溫鏡面本身就是一個冷凝泵：真空中殘留的水分子一碰到 20 K 的鏡面就會吸附，逐漸形成分子層，改變鍍膜的反射率並增加吸收與散射。KAGRA 以長導管屏蔽限制殘氣進入的立體角，但吸附無法完全避免，必要時需回溫讓分子脫附，而每次回溫與再冷卻都要數週時間。","textEn":"A cryogenic mirror is itself a cryopump: residual water molecules in the vacuum that strike the 20 K surface stick and slowly build a molecular layer that changes coating reflectance and adds absorption and scatter. KAGRA uses long duct shields to restrict the solid angle through which residual gas can arrive, but adsorption cannot be avoided completely, so the mirrors must sometimes be warmed to desorb the layer, and every warm-up and re-cooling takes weeks.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff\" is correct?","options":["高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。","只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。","低溫鏡面本身就是一個冷凝泵：真空中殘留的水分子一碰到 20 K 的鏡面就會吸附，逐漸形成分子層，改變鍍膜的反射率並增加吸收與散射。"],"optionsEn":["A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas.","Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.","A cryogenic mirror is itself a cryopump: residual water molecules in the vacuum that strike the 20 K surface stick and slowly build a molecular layer that changes coating reflectance and adds absorption and scatter."],"answer":2,"explanation":"低溫鏡面本身就是一個冷凝泵：真空中殘留的水分子一碰到 20 K 的鏡面就會吸附，逐漸形成分子層，改變鍍膜的反射率並增加吸收與散射。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A cryogenic mirror is itself a cryopump: residual water molecules in the vacuum that strike the 20 K surface stick and slowly build a molecular layer that changes coating reflectance and adds absorption and scatter. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a499-v12-30","title":"地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「冷鏡面分子吸附與回溫」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cold-mirror adsorption and warm-up” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：水分子撞擊率 Φ = P/√(2πmkT)：P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa、T = 300 K、m = 18 u 時 Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹。以冰密度 930 kg/m³ 換算，無遮蔽時成長約 1.2×10⁻¹³ m/s ≈ 10 nm/天；導管屏蔽若把可見立體角降為 10⁻³（假設），約 3.6 nm/年。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The water impingement rate is Φ = P/√(2πmkT): for P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa, T = 300 K and m = 18 u, Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹. Converting with an ice density of 930 kg/m³, an unshielded mirror grows a layer at about 1.2×10⁻¹³ m/s ≈ 10 nm per day; duct shields that cut the visible solid angle to 10⁻³ (assumption) bring it to about 3.6 nm per year. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以殘氣分析儀監測各真空段的水分壓；定期量測臂腔精細度與鏡面反射率的變化趨勢，並以鏡面散射光相機追蹤散射增加；回溫後重測精細度，確認損耗是否回到基準，以此區分可逆的分子吸附與不可逆的鍍膜損傷。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Monitor water partial pressure in each vacuum section with residual-gas analysers; track trends of arm finesse and mirror reflectance periodically and follow scatter growth with mirror-scatter cameras; after a warm-up remeasure finesse to see whether losses return to baseline, separating reversible adsorption from irreversible coating damage.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"水分子撞擊率 Φ = P/√(2πmkT)：P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa、T = 300 K、m = 18 u 時 Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹。以冰密度 930 kg/m³ 換算，無遮蔽時成長約 1.2×10⁻¹³ m/s ≈ 10 nm/天；導管屏蔽若把可見立體角降為 10⁻³（假設），約 3.6 nm/年。","textEn":"The water impingement rate is Φ = P/√(2πmkT): for P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa, T = 300 K and m = 18 u, Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹. Converting with an ice density of 930 kg/m³, an unshielded mirror grows a layer at about 1.2×10⁻¹³ m/s ≈ 10 nm per day; duct shields that cut the visible solid angle to 10⁻³ (assumption) bring it to about 3.6 nm per year.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["水分子撞擊率 Φ = P/√(2πmkT)：P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa、T = 300 K、m = 18 u 時 Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹。","熔融石英在室溫表現最好，所以低溫下也一定是最佳鏡材。","低溫干涉儀和室溫干涉儀一樣，提高雷射功率就一定提升靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["The water impingement rate is Φ = P/√(2πmkT): for P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa, T = 300 K and m = 18 u, Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹.","Fused silica is best at room temperature, so it must also be best when cold.","Like a room-temperature detector, a cryogenic interferometer always gains sensitivity from more laser power."],"answer":0,"explanation":"水分子撞擊率 Φ = P/√(2πmkT)：P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa、T = 300 K、m = 18 u 時 Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The water impingement rate is Φ = P/√(2πmkT): for P = 1×10⁻⁷ Pa, T = 300 K and m = 18 u, Φ ≈ 3.6×10¹⁵ m⁻²s⁻¹. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a499-v12-31","title":"地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「冷鏡面分子吸附與回溫」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Cold-mirror adsorption and warm-up” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以殘氣分析儀監測各真空段的水分壓；定期量測臂腔精細度與鏡面反射率的變化趨勢，並以鏡面散射光相機追蹤散射增加；回溫後重測精細度，確認損耗是否回到基準，以此區分可逆的分子吸附與不可逆的鍍膜損傷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Monitor water partial pressure in each vacuum section with residual-gas analysers; track trends of arm finesse and mirror reflectance periodically and follow scatter growth with mirror-scatter cameras; after a warm-up remeasure finesse to see whether losses return to baseline, separating reversible adsorption from irreversible coating damage. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若冷卻前真空烘烤不足或導管屏蔽溫度過高，分子層在數週內就讓精細度明顯下降，被誤判為鍍膜劣化而考慮更換鏡面；地震後若只檢查真空而未重新量測懸吊共振頻率與對準，偵測器會帶著隱藏的摩擦或碰觸問題重新加入觀測。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If vacuum bake-out before cooling is insufficient or duct shields run too warm, a molecular layer visibly lowers finesse within weeks and may be misjudged as coating degradation that calls for mirror replacement; after an earthquake, checking only the vacuum without remeasuring suspension resonances and alignment lets the detector rejoin observation with hidden rubbing or contact problems.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以殘氣分析儀監測各真空段的水分壓；定期量測臂腔精細度與鏡面反射率的變化趨勢，並以鏡面散射光相機追蹤散射增加；回溫後重測精細度，確認損耗是否回到基準，以此區分可逆的分子吸附與不可逆的鍍膜損傷。","textEn":"Monitor water partial pressure in each vacuum section with residual-gas analysers; track trends of arm finesse and mirror reflectance periodically and follow scatter growth with mirror-scatter cameras; after a warm-up remeasure finesse to see whether losses return to baseline, separating reversible adsorption from irreversible coating damage.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以殘氣分析儀監測各真空段的水分壓。","隔振鏈夠長，就不必在意任何連到鏡子的其他連線。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Monitor water partial pressure in each vacuum section with residual-gas analysers.","A long enough isolation chain makes other connections to the mirror irrelevant."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以殘氣分析儀監測各真空段的水分壓；定期量測臂腔精細度與鏡面反射率的變化趨勢，並以鏡面散射光相機追蹤散射增加；回溫後重測精細度，確認損耗是否回到基準，以此區分可逆的分子吸附與不可逆的鍍膜損傷。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Monitor water partial pressure in each vacuum section with residual-gas analysers; track trends of arm finesse and mirror reflectance periodically and follow scatter growth with mirror-scatter cameras; after a warm-up remeasure finesse to see whether losses return to baseline, separating reversible adsorption from irreversible coating damage. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a499-v12-32","title":"地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"prerequisiteIds":["a499-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「冷鏡面分子吸附與回溫」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Cold-mirror adsorption and warm-up” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若冷卻前真空烘烤不足或導管屏蔽溫度過高，分子層在數週內就讓精細度明顯下降，被誤判為鍍膜劣化而考慮更換鏡面；地震後若只檢查真空而未重新量測懸吊共振頻率與對準，偵測器會帶著隱藏的摩擦或碰觸問題重新加入觀測。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If vacuum bake-out before cooling is insufficient or duct shields run too warm, a molecular layer visibly lowers finesse within weeks and may be misjudged as coating degradation that calls for mirror replacement; after an earthquake, checking only the vacuum without remeasuring suspension resonances and alignment lets the detector rejoin observation with hidden rubbing or contact problems. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接紀錄應包含各鏡面溫度歷史、精細度與回收增益趨勢、冷凍機與真空狀態，以及每次回溫的原因與結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record should hold each mirror's temperature history, finesse and recycling-gain trends, cryocooler and vacuum status, and the reason and outcome of every warm-up.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「高真空中的低溫鏡面不會被任何氣體污染。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A cryogenic mirror in high vacuum cannot be contaminated by any gas.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a499-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若冷卻前真空烘烤不足或導管屏蔽溫度過高，分子層在數週內就讓精細度明顯下降，被誤判為鍍膜劣化而考慮更換鏡面；地震後若只檢查真空而未重新量測懸吊共振頻率與對準，偵測器會帶著隱藏的摩擦或碰觸問題重新加入觀測。","textEn":"If vacuum bake-out before cooling is insufficient or duct shields run too warm, a molecular layer visibly lowers finesse within weeks and may be misjudged as coating degradation that calls for mirror replacement; after an earthquake, checking only the vacuum without remeasuring suspension resonances and alignment lets the detector rejoin observation with hidden rubbing or contact problems.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]},{"id":"a499-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「地下低溫營運：冷凝污染、地震恢復與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Underground cryogenic operation: cryo-contamination, earthquake recovery and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","只要放到地底，重力波干涉儀的所有雜訊都會大幅下降。","若冷卻前真空烘烤不足或導管屏蔽溫度過高，分子層在數週內就讓精細度明顯下降，被誤判為鍍膜劣化而考慮更換鏡面。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Putting an interferometer underground lowers all of its noise sources dramatically.","If vacuum bake-out before cooling is insufficient or duct shields run too warm, a molecular layer visibly lowers finesse within weeks and may be misjudged as coating degradation that calls for mirror replacement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若冷卻前真空烘烤不足或導管屏蔽溫度過高，分子層在數週內就讓精細度明顯下降，被誤判為鍍膜劣化而考慮更換鏡面；地震後若只檢查真空而未重新量測懸吊共振頻率與對準，偵測器會帶著隱藏的摩擦或碰觸問題重新加入觀測。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If vacuum bake-out before cooling is insufficient or duct shields run too warm, a molecular layer visibly lowers finesse within weeks and may be misjudged as coating degradation that calls for mirror replacement; after an earthquake, checking only the vacuum without remeasuring suspension resonances and alignment lets the detector rejoin observation with hidden rubbing or contact problems. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-icrr-kagra-overview","v12o-kagra-overview-design-history","v12o-kagra-project-about","v12o-kagra-o4-resumption"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
